      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Hey everyone!\n\nI'm currently planning a ~900 MHz 802.11ah HaLoW RF front end for the gf180mcuD process. Since the open PDK ships no RF characterization; has anyone modeled on-chip passives on this process? I'm specifically looking at on-chip inductors.",
